{"id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theory-set.md","title":"Theory Set","display":"df-theory-set — Theory Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theory-set","aliases":["92-df-theory-set"],"display":"df-theory-set — Theory Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-theorem]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 56–60；本地同语言系统族的定理集","source_status":"原书系统定理集合的本地实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theory-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theory-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-set — Theory Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60c7ba64b8865701\" href=\"?note=60c7ba64b8865701\" title=\"92-df-theorem\">92-df-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 56–60；本地同语言系统族的定理集"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书系统定理集合的本地实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-theory-set-—-Theory-Set-$\\mathrm{Th}$\">df-theory-set — Theory Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\Sigma_G,A,R)\\)</span> 是同一算术语言上的形式系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，规则只在本地公式间推理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 分别见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}\\)</span> 是本节点定义的闭句定理集构造器；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\)</span> 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"60c7ba64b8865701\" href=\"?note=60c7ba64b8865701\" title=\"92-df-theorem\">92-df-theorem</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G:\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Th}(G)=\\mathrm{Thm}_G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G:\\mathcal F\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Th}(G)=\\mathrm{Thm}_G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>它对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\">\\(G&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\)</span> 采用相同参数签名，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的旧意义保持不变。开放可证公式不在这个闭句集合中。\n公理及规则有效且证明可枚举时，定理码集是 c.e.；该有效性是额外条件。句法不完备要求某句及其否定均不属于定理集，不能简写成定理集不是全部句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-theory-set-—-Theory-Set-$\\mathrm{Th}$","text":"df-theory-set — Theory Set $\\mathrm{Th}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"60c7ba64b8865701","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[H